OL,3,GNEWSAFunds raised to buy church ahead
OL,4,Aof theatre plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign to raise money to buy and
OL,7,Fconvert a Sheffield church that has
OL,8,Fstood empty for about 15 years has
OL,9,Freached its #100,000 target.
OL,11,FThe overall price to buy Trinity
OL,12,FMethodist Church in Woodhouse is
OL,13,F#125,000, with the building's current
OL,14,Fowner pledging #25,000.
OL,16,FThe Woodhouse and District Community
OL,17,FForum (WDCF) said in May it had six
OL,18,Fmonths to raise the cash, as part of
OL,19,Fits plan to create a community theatre
OL,20,Fand social space.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
